MODULE 7: EXCEL MARKSHEET IMPORT AND EXPORT
This is a key feature because we do not want to force schools to abandon their existing Excel workflow.
Features:
Upload existing Excel marksheets.
Support agreed Excel templates and common column arrangements.
Identify student admission numbers.
Match students to existing school records.
Identify unmatched students.
