10. FINAL PRODUCT DIRECTION
Our goal is not simply to create another school management system.
We want to build a solution that specializes in examination processing and student report generation for Ugandan secondary schools.
Our competitive advantage should come from:
Working with schools' existing examination workflows.
Making marks entry easier.
Supporting existing Excel marksheets.
Preventing examination processing errors.
Supporting configurable CBC assessment and reporting.
Reducing the workload of teachers and Directors of Studies.
Generating professional student reports quickly.
Making academic performance information easier to understand.
The guiding product principle:
SchuleFlow should make examination processing so simple that teachers spend less time handling marks and more time concentrating on teaching.
Our first development milestone: Deliver a working MVP that allows one school to register students, enter or import marks, automatically calculate results, review and approve marks, and generate professional student report cards.
All additional features should build around this foundation.
